starting and receiving, shield advancement, and crossing special sections", and the
shield construction safety risks were divided into The 4M1E method is used to
classify the shield construction safety risks into five aspects: "personnel factors,
mechanical equipment factors, construction material factors, construction technology
factors and surrounding environment factors", and 40 risk factors are identified
through the WBS-RBS coupling matrix to form a list of risk factors.
(2) Based on the list of risk factors, form a risk evaluation index system, invite
experts to score the judgment matrix of the criterion layer and the index layer, round
up the arithmetic average of all experts' scores to form a final score table, apply the
hierarchical analysis method to discriminate and calculate the weight of each index
relative to the previous level.
(3) Experts are invited to evaluate each risk factor in the index level, and the risk
evaluation results are counted to establish a judgment matrix, and the risk evaluation
is carried out by applying the fuzzy comprehensive evaluation method. The risk of
propulsion is medium, and the risk of crossing special sections is high. The final
conclusion is that the construction safety risk of the shield section of the project is a
level 3 risk, with a high risk level, which is at an undesirable level, and that
corresponding risk treatment measures must be taken to reduce the risk and
strengthen the construction monitoring, while meeting the cost of risk reduction is not
higher than the loss caused by the risk. At the end of the risk evaluation, the relevant
high risk points are briefly proposed with countermeasures and recommendations.
Key Words: Super Large Diameter Shield Security risk assessment
